     4492   run create-scnblist-hist in this-procedure (input 'ДОБАВЛЕНИЕ':U
     4493                                        , input-output v-seq
     4494                                        , input 0
     4495                                        , input '0':U
     4496                                        , input "# Список кодов очищен."
     4497                                        , input 0
     4498                                        , input "clear"
     4499                                        , input '':U
     4500                                        , input '':U
     4501                                        , input '':U
     4502                                        , input ?
     4503                                        ).
     4504   display
     4505   tot-lns @ f-tot-lns
     4506   ? @ ub.clients.obj-name
     4507   ? @ ub.gds-prt.node-name
     4508   ? @ ub.bar-code.b-code with frame Dialog-Frame.
     4509   run UI-on.
     4510   END.
     4511   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF RS-Status IN FRAME Dialog-Frame DO:
     4512     assign
     4513     RS-status.
     4514   END.
     4515   ON CHOOSE OF b-cd IN FRAME Dialog-Frame DO:
